---
import Mark from './Mark.astro';
---
<figure class="flow-scene motion-scene" aria-label="Illustrative synthetic action: command, broker, HTTPS provider">
  <div class="flow-node command-node"><Mark name="terminal" /><h3>Your command</h3><p>Keeps its HTTPS URL.</p><code>Temporary proxy capability</code></div>
  <div class="flow-rail" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><span>Permission granted</span></div>
  <div class="flow-node broker-node"><img class="broker-mark" src="/brand/av-symbol.svg" width="48" height="48" alt="" /><h3>Agents Vault</h3><p>Reviews the action.<br />Injects the credential upstream.</p><code>Command · host · version · limits</code></div>
  <div class="flow-rail outbound" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><span>Credential inserted</span></div>
  <div class="flow-node provider-node"><Mark name="globe" /><h3>HTTPS provider</h3><p>Receives the injected header.</p><code>Exact approved host</code></div>
  <figcaption>Illustrative synthetic action · Host commands are not confined.</figcaption>
</figure>
